  m_Name: JumpEventOne
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: JumpEventOne
  dialogueLines:
  - "The player pressed Space. Nothing happened. There\u2019s no jumping here."
  - "The player has pressed Space. Unfortunately, this game doesn\u2019t have jumping."
  - Space was pressed. The player remains firmly on the ground.
  - "The player tried to jump. Sadly, Space isn\u2019t going to help with that."
  - The player pressed Space. The narrator wonders what they expected to happen.
  - "Looking for a jump? Sorry. Space doesn\u2019t do anything here."
  - The player has discovered the Space key. It appears to be completely useless.
  - The player pressed Space again. Still no jumping. Still nothing.
  - Space has been pressed. The player is not going anywhere vertically.
  - "The player tried pressing Space. Nice idea, but jumping isn\u2019t an option
    here."
